{
  "name": "Helped - Employment Contract Draft Autofill",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "hook": 0,
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "hook": {
              "data": {
                "editable": "true"
              },
              "label": "Create Contract Draft Autofill webhook after import"
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "hook",
            "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
            "label": "Webhook",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "maxResults",
            "type": "number",
            "label": "Maximum number of results"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "Create a new webhook unique to contract autofill. Do not reuse the biodata webhook."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 250,
          "y": 0
        }
      },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 27,
              "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
              "version": 0,
              "parameters": {
                "makeConnectionId": 9990574
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Text contract draft autofill - authorized",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                      "b": "contract_autofill",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    },
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.fileDataBase64}}",
                      "b": "",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              "mapper": {
                "files": [],
                "message": "Website extraction instructions:\n{{1.systemPrompt}}\n\nPDF text and requested output schema:\n{{1.userPrompt}}",
                "threadId": "pdf-autofill-{{ifempty(1.requestId; \"anonymous\")}}",
                "outputType": "text",
                "tokenLimit": "8192",
                "modelConfig": {
                  "timeout": "",
                  "recursionLimit": "300",
                  "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "1"
                },
                "defaultModel": "gpt-5-nano",
                "systemPrompt": "You are a careful employment contract extraction assistant. Follow the website extraction instructions exactly. Never invent values. Return only the requested JSON object. Do not use Markdown or comments.",
                "promptCaching": "none",
                "fallbackEnabled": false,
                "reasoningEffort": "low"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 550,
                  "y": -120
                },
                "notes": "Dedicated employment contract draft extraction. Select a Make AI Provider connection and a model that supports PDF and image attachments."
              },
              "tools": []
            },
            {
              "id": 28,
              "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "body": "{\n  \"content\": \"{{escapeJSON(27.response)}}\",\n  \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n}",
                "status": "200",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 850,
                  "y": -120
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 31,
              "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
              "version": 0,
              "parameters": {
                "makeConnectionId": 9990574
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "PDF or image contract draft autofill - authorized",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                      "b": "contract_autofill",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    },
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.fileDataBase64}}",
                      "b": "",
                      "o": "text:notEqual"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              "mapper": {
                "files": [
                  {
                    "fileName": "{{1.fileName}}",
                    "data": "{{toBinary(1.fileDataBase64; \"base64\")}}"
                  }
                ],
                "message": "Website extraction instructions:\n{{1.systemPrompt}}\n\nPDF text and requested output schema:\n{{1.userPrompt}}",
                "threadId": "pdf-autofill-{{ifempty(1.requestId; \"anonymous\")}}",
                "outputType": "text",
                "tokenLimit": "8192",
                "modelConfig": {
                  "timeout": "",
                  "recursionLimit": "300",
                  "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "1"
                },
                "defaultModel": "gpt-5-nano",
                "systemPrompt": "You are a careful employment contract extraction assistant. Follow the website extraction instructions exactly. Never invent values. Return only the requested JSON object. Do not use Markdown or comments.",
                "promptCaching": "none",
                "fallbackEnabled": false,
                "reasoningEffort": "low"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 550,
                  "y": 120
                },
                "notes": "Dedicated employment contract draft extraction. Select a Make AI Provider connection and a model that supports PDF and image attachments."
              },
              "tools": []
            },
            {
              "id": 32,
              "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "body": "{\n  \"content\": \"{{escapeJSON(31.response)}}\",\n  \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n}",
                "status": "200",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 850,
                  "y": 120
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 29,
              "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "filter": {
                "name": "Unsupported scenario",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                      "b": "contract_autofill",
                      "o": "text:notEqual"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              "mapper": {
                "body": "{\"error\":\"Unsupported website automation scenario\"}",
                "status": "400",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 550,
                  "y": 140
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "slots": null,
      "confidential": true,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "zone": "eu1.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "Dedicated Make AI Agent scenario for employment contract draft extraction. It has its own custom webhook, separate from the biodata autofill scenario.",
      "",
      "AFTER IMPORT:",
      "1. Create a new custom webhook named Contract Draft Autofill. Run once with a sample request so Make learns systemPrompt, userPrompt, fileName, fileMimeType, and fileDataBase64.",
      "2. In both AI Agent modules, select the Make AI Provider connection and a model that can read PDF and image attachments. Keep the binary file mapping toBinary(1.fileDataBase64; \"base64\").",
      "3. Set the new webhook URL as the Worker secret MAKE_CONTRACT_AUTOFILL_WEBHOOK_URL.",
      "4. Test with a contract draft and confirm the response is JSON containing maid, agency, employer, spouse, notificationDate, and familyMembers.",
      "5. Activate this scenario. Biodata uploads continue to use the existing PDF Biodata Autofill scenario and webhook.",
      "",
      "Requests use scenario=contract_autofill. No shared token is required; the dedicated webhook URL is the connection setting."
    ]
  }
}
